  "description": {
    "en": "Babolat RPM Rough is a textured octagonal co-polyester monofilament designed for maximum spin and precise control. Its rough high-density co-polyester surface increases ball bite, while the octagonal profile further enhances rotation. The embossed logo helps reduce friction and improve durability. RPM Rough is aimed at advanced and tournament players with fast swing speeds who want aggressive spin and controlled trajectories.",

    "zh": "Babolat RPM Rough 是一款粗糙表面、八边形结构的共聚酯单丝球线，核心定位是极强旋转与精准控制。高密度共聚酯的粗糙纹理能够增强咬球感，八边形截面进一步提升球的旋转；表面压印设计则有助于降低摩擦并提升耐久性。非常适合挥拍速度快、追求重上旋与攻击性弹道的高级和比赛型球员。"
  },

